{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arbeiter is a survival-management game that puts you in the shoes of a low-income worker navigating daily life. Face everyday challenges, tackle workplace struggles, and find ways to survive. Burn out, get fired, walk out, achieve collective victories, or carve out your own independent path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Creation:</strong> Customize your worker's gender and starting traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural NPCs: </strong>Meet different coworkers, neighbors, and strangers in each playthrough, each with their own traits and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Planning: </strong>Structure your days by dividing time between work, meals, rest, and social activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job Routines:</strong> Take on a variety of tasks in different workplaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Dynamics:</strong> Build trust, tension, or solidarity with coworkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worker Meetings: </strong>Organize meetings with colleagues, discuss agendas, and make collective decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Union Progression:</strong> Join the union, climb the ranks, and influence workplace policies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884080?t=1772808123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884080/c834ac0e14fe1174e84b33d8ef3fb9747768780e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772808123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884080/58dd5bd9cf9176ba365369ca50599345ba0822aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772808123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_